  "title": "frame: have a dissector table for custom binary options.",
  "description": "Move the Black Box Log option dissection code to\nepan/dissectors/packet-bblog.c, and register it in the aforementioned\ndissector table.\n\nThis removes the last of the code in packet-frame.c that knows anything\nabut Netflix custom options, and allows it to handle all custom binary\noptions, as long as they register a handler in the aforementioned\ndissector table.\n\nMake the code in packet-frame.c that generates the top-level frame\nprotocol tree item start ut with common code to generate the entry,\nfollowed by initial per-record-type code tha appends the relevant data\nto that enry.",
